# Extra ML libraries layered on top of the anyscale/ray-torch release-test image
# (py3.14, cu12.8) for Train release tests that used to run on the ray-ml image.
#
# The ray-torch lock already provides torch/torchvision/torchmetrics/transformers/
# datasets/sentence-transformers, so only what the ml image additionally carried
# is listed here:
#   lightning  -> torch_lightning (import lightning.pytorch, ray.train.lightning)
#   accelerate -> huggingface_accelerate, and transformers.Trainer requires it
#   evaluate   -> huggingface_transformers, huggingface_accelerate
lightning
accelerate
evaluate
